  by: agent  # 74ad
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 74ad
  clock: 2  # 74ad
  nonce: 74ad  # 74ad
  message: "PHASE 0 RE-VERIFICATION AT TIP, 2026-08-25, dev e41a655d6d. REPRODUCES, with\ncontrols, on files (is_likely_minified takes a Path):\n\n  py 'regenerated by' docstring : loose=True   strict=False\n  py plain docstring            : loose=False  strict=False   <- CONTROL\n  go '// generated by ...'      : loose=True   strict=False\n  go '// leading comment'       : loose=False  strict=False   <- CONTROL\n\nloose = supply_chain.is_likely_minified heuristic 3\nstrict = supply_chain._GENERATED_HEADER_PATTERN\n\nBoth predicates are unchanged at tip and still disagree. Confirmed Phase 1\nmember, jointly with INV-pogob: ONE comment-anchored predicate, not two."  # 74ad
